<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρδι-ακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the heart</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span> Rhet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				801.36
			</span></i>: in Medic. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					66
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκοπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.302
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
				</span></i>
			 Aphr. <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				98.23
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.368
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κινδυνεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.84
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>suffering from heart disease</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				9.19
			</span></i>; but prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρδιαλγής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.10d
			</span></i>.</div>
